@startuml cancer-model-ru
hide circle
hide empty members
title Как устроена запись онкологического регистра

class Patient [[https://dhp.uz/fhir/core/StructureDefinition-uz-core-patient.html{Открыть профиль UZ Core Patient}]]
class CancerCondition [[StructureDefinition-cancer-condition.html{Открыть профиль CancerCondition}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerEpisodeOfCare [[StructureDefinition-cancer-episode-of-care.html{Открыть профиль CancerEpisodeOfCare}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerEncounter [[StructureDefinition-cancer-encounter.html{Открыть профиль CancerEncounter}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerObservationTumorMorphology [[StructureDefinition-cancer-observation-tumor-morphology.html{Открыть профиль CancerObservationTumorMorphology}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerObservationBehavior [[StructureDefinition-cancer-observation-behavior.html{Открыть профиль CancerObservationBehavior}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerObservationHistologicGrade [[StructureDefinition-cancer-observation-histologic-grade.html{Открыть профиль CancerObservationHistologicGrade}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerObservationMetastase [[StructureDefinition-cancer-observation-metastase.html{Открыть профиль CancerObservationMetastase}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerObservationTNMStageGroup [[StructureDefinition-cancer-observation-tnm-stage-group.html{Открыть профиль CancerObservationTNMStageGroup}]] #E8F0FE
class CancerObservationTNMCategory [[StructureDefinition-cancer-observation-tnm-category.html{Открыть профиль CancerObservationTNMCategory}]] #E8F0FE


Patient "1" <-- "0..*" CancerEpisodeOfCare : « patient »
Patient "1" <-- "0..*" CancerEncounter : « subject »
Patient "1" <-- "0..*" CancerCondition : « subject »
CancerEpisodeOfCare "0..*" <-- "0..*" CancerEncounter : « episodeOfCare »
CancerEpisodeOfCare "0..*" --> "1" CancerCondition : « diagnosis.condition »
CancerEncounter "0..*" -right-> "1" CancerCondition : « diagnosis.condition »
CancerCondition "0..*" --> "0..1" CancerEncounter : « encounter »
CancerCondition "1" <-- "0..*" CancerObservationTumorMorphology : « focus »
CancerCondition "1" <-- "0..*" CancerObservationMetastase : « focus »
CancerCondition "1" <-- "0..*" CancerObservationTNMStageGroup : « focus »
CancerCondition "0..*" --> "0..*" CancerObservationTNMStageGroup : « stage.assessment »
CancerObservationTumorMorphology "0..*" --> "0..*" CancerObservationBehavior : « hasMember »
CancerObservationTumorMorphology "0..*" --> "0..*" CancerObservationHistologicGrade : « hasMember »
CancerObservationTNMStageGroup "0..*" --> "0..*" CancerObservationTNMCategory : « hasMember »
CancerCondition "1" <-- "0..*" CancerObservationBehavior : « focus »
CancerCondition "1" <-- "0..*" CancerObservationHistologicGrade : « focus »
CancerCondition "1" <-- "0..*" CancerObservationTNMCategory : « focus »

note "Каждое наблюдение (Observation) также\nссылается на пациента через « subject »" as N1
N1 .. CancerObservationMetastase

caption Клинический граф: ссылки на организации, медработников и других участников не показаны, чтобы схема оставалась читаемой.

@enduml
